<title>USA: Meridian Sports names Hanson CEO.</title>
<headline>Meridian Sports names Hanson CEO.</headline>
<dateline>VENORE, Tenn. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Sports Inc said Friday it had named director J. Eric Hanson as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Hanson, an officer of MacAndrews &amp; Forbes, Meridian's principal shareholder, succeeds Jim Hoag.</p>
<p>Hoag will remain chairman of Meridian's MasterCraft unit.</p>
